1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,700
Baarish ne is baar phir fasal barbaad kar di.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,325
Papa, polyhouse lagao! Andar mausam ka koi asar nahi. Rangeen shimla mirch ugao!

3
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:12,031
Polyhouse to laakhon ka hai, Simran!

4
00:00:12,331 --> 00:00:17,489
Aadha ekad ka polyhouse. Aadha paisa subsidy se, apna lagbhag 8 lakh.

5
00:00:17,789 --> 00:00:23,881
Drip sinchai lagao, aur baagwani vibhag se training lo. Ek galti poori fasal le doobti hai.

6
00:00:24,431 --> 00:00:29,253
Sardar ji, hamare supermarket ko roz laal-peeli shimla mirch chahiye!

7
00:00:29,553 --> 00:00:32,516
Ekdam taaza, chamakdaar. 100 rupaye kilo!

8
00:00:32,816 --> 00:00:37,293
Aadhe ekad se saal mein kai ton. Kharcha nikaal kar 6 lakh se zyada.

9
00:00:37,593 --> 00:00:42,435
Seedhe hotel aur supermarket se contract karo. Mandi ka bichauliya hatao!

10
00:00:42,735 --> 00:00:47,249
Baarish ho ya dhoop, fasal ekdam khoob! Harpal ki life set!
